From c9a16c9cf0e04e0a61ae76c064b0d14aca8faaba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: World of Warcraft <warcraft@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:30:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Entry point for the folder name the module browser installs
 it under

The module's install folder is mod-adaptive-autoattack, but the module browser installs a module
under its repository's name (Auto-Attack-Forever): AzerothCore's generated loader then calls
AddAuto_Attack_ForeverScripts(), which the module doesn't define (a link error). The entry point
is added, calling the module's own.
